                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "a fun little FPS with a cool terrain lowering/raising mechanic!\n\nI'm not the best at FPS games, so I did struggle quite a bit with aiming, so once I got the homing attack ability, I was using that a lot, and it made things a lot easier and more fun.\n\n\nI love some of the little details, like Atlas having unique dialogue for if you just leave in the middle of it talking to you, and some of the boss fights are really cool! There are some pretty cool uses of the terrain lowering/raising mechanic too, like raising and lowering bits of the rails so that they'll give you enough momentum to be launched where you want to go, and [spoiler] that underwater boss fight where you use that mechanic to destroy the boss's limbs and damage it. [/spoiler]\n\nEnjoyed the story too, the cutscenes are cool!",
